{\pard\plain \s82\li720\widctlpar\ql\adjustright \fs20\cgrid \zwjNote that when such software is used, numbers that are integers and are in the range { \field\flddirty {\*\fldinst  INCLUDEPICTURE "form_0.png" \\d \\*MERGEFORMAT}{\fldrslt Image}} are interoperable in the sense that implementations will agree exactly on their numeric values. \par
